{"html":"<section id=\"flows\" data-panel=\"flows\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Animated flows</p><h1>14 call, signal, and data flows</h1><p class=\"lede\">Each picture moves a packet along the study path. Emergency stays on the voice platform. Reduced motion hides the packet.</p><div class=\"atlas-grid\"><article class=\"atlas-card\" data-atlas-diagram=\"flow-completion\" data-animated=\"1\" data-kind=\"ladder\"><h3><a href=\"#atlas\">Completion ladder</a></h3><svg class=\"atlas-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 700 258\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Completion ladder\"><rect width=\"700\" height=\"258\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#070b16\"/><defs><marker id=\"flow-completion-arr\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0 L7 3 L0 6 Z\" fill=\"#34d399\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"100\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67e8f9\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">App</text><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#1e3a52\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67e8f9\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">API</text><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#1e3a52\"/><text x=\"460\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67e8f9\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Model</text><line x1=\"460\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#1e3a52\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"78\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"78\" stroke=\"#34d399\" marker-end=\"url(#flow-completion-arr)\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">443, pinned host</text><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#34d399\" marker-end=\"url(#flow-completion-arr)\"/><text x=\"370\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">token budget</text><line x1=\"460\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#34d399\" marker-end=\"url(#flow-completion-arr)\"/><text x=\"370\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">next-token scores</text><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"204\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"204\" stroke=\"#34d399\" marker-end=\"url(#flow-completion-arr)\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"196\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">text or timeout</text><path id=\"flow-completion-route\" d=\"M 100 78 L 280 78 L 280 120 L 460 120 L 460 162 L 280 162 L 280 204 L 100 204\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"none\"/><circle class=\"pkt\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\"><animateMotion dur=\"4.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"><mpath href=\"#flow-completion-route\"/></animateMotion></circle></svg><p>One HTTPS call. The model returns scores over the next token.</p><p><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-enlarge>Enlarge</button></p></article><article class=\"atlas-card\" data-atlas-diagram=\"flow-rag\" data-animated=\"1\" data-kind=\"data\"><h3><a href=\"#atlas\">Retrieval data flow</a></h3><svg class=\"atlas-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 880 258\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Retrieval data flow\"><rect width=\"880\" height=\"258\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#070b16\"/><defs><marker id=\"flow-rag-arr\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0 L7 3 L0 6 Z\" fill=\"#34d399\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"100\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67e8f9\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Question</text><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#1e3a52\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67e8f9\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Index</text><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#1e3a52\"/><text x=\"460\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67e8f9\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Pack</text><line x1=\"460\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#1e3a52\"/><text x=\"640\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67e8f9\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Model</text><line x1=\"640\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"640\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#1e3a52\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"78\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"78\" stroke=\"#34d399\" marker-end=\"url(#flow-rag-arr)\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">query vector, same model id</text><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#34d399\" marker-end=\"url(#flow-rag-arr)\"/><text x=\"370\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">chunk ids</text><line x1=\"460\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"640\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#34d399\" marker-end=\"url(#flow-rag-arr)\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">data, not instructions</text><line x1=\"640\" y1=\"204\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"204\" stroke=\"#34d399\" marker-end=\"url(#flow-rag-arr)\"/><text x=\"370\" y=\"196\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">cite or refuse</text><path id=\"flow-rag-route\" d=\"M 100 78 L 280 78 L 280 120 L 460 120 L 460 162 L 640 162 L 640 204 L 100 204\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"none\"/><circle class=\"pkt\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\"><animateMotion dur=\"4.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"><mpath href=\"#flow-rag-route\"/></animateMotion></circle></svg><p>Find a span, cite the id, or refuse. The model does not mint the source.</p><p><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-enlarge>Enlarge</button></p></article><article class=\"atlas-card\" data-atlas-diagram=\"flow-tool\" data-animated=\"1\" data-kind=\"signal\"><h3><a href=\"#atlas\">Tool-call ladder</a></h3><svg class=\"atlas-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 700 258\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Tool-call ladder\"><rect width=\"700\" height=\"258\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#070b16\"/><defs><marker id=\"flow-tool-arr\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0 L7 3 L0 6 Z\" fill=\"#34d399\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"100\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67e8f9\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Model</text><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#1e3a52\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67e8f9\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Host</text><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#1e3a52\"/><text x=\"460\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67e8f9\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Tool</text><line x1=\"460\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#1e3a52\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"78\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"78\" stroke=\"#34d399\" marker-end=\"url(#flow-tool-arr)\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">tool name and arguments</text><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#34d399\" marker-end=\"url(#flow-tool-arr)\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">permission check</text><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#34d399\" marker-end=\"url(#flow-tool-arr)\"/><text x=\"370\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">handler, idempotent</text><line x1=\"460\" y1=\"204\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"204\" stroke=\"#34d399\" marker-end=\"url(#flow-tool-arr)\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"196\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">result in the trace</text><path id=\"flow-tool-route\" d=\"M 100 78 L 280 78 L 280 120 L 280 120 L 280 162 L 460 162 L 460 204 L 100 204\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"none\"/><circle class=\"pkt\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\"><animateMotion dur=\"4.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"><mpath href=\"#flow-tool-route\"/></animateMotion></circle></svg><p>The host runs the tool. A schema match is not permission.</p><p><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-enlarge>Enlarge</button></p></article><article class=\"atlas-card\" data-atlas-diagram=\"flow-voice\" data-animated=\"1\" data-kind=\"ladder\"><h3><a href=\"#atlas\">Voice ladder</a></h3><svg class=\"atlas-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1060 300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Voice ladder\"><rect width=\"1060\" height=\"300\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#070b16\"/><defs><marker id=\"flow-voice-arr\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0 L7 3 L0 6 Z\" fill=\"#34d399\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"100\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67e8f9\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Caller</text><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"284\" stroke=\"#1e3a52\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67e8f9\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">SIP</text><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"284\" stroke=\"#1e3a52\"/><text x=\"460\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67e8f9\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">ASR</text><line x1=\"460\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"284\" stroke=\"#1e3a52\"/><text x=\"640\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67e8f9\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Model</text><line x1=\"640\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"640\" y2=\"284\" stroke=\"#1e3a52\"/><text x=\"820\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67e8f9\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">TTS</text><line x1=\"820\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"820\" y2=\"284\" stroke=\"#1e3a52\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"78\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"78\" stroke=\"#34d399\" marker-end=\"url(#flow-voice-arr)\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">signaling</text><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#34d399\" marker-end=\"url(#flow-voice-arr)\"/><text x=\"370\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">audio already captured</text><line x1=\"460\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"640\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#34d399\" marker-end=\"url(#flow-voice-arr)\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">transcript</text><line x1=\"640\" y1=\"204\" x2=\"820\" y2=\"204\" stroke=\"#34d399\" marker-end=\"url(#flow-voice-arr)\"/><text x=\"730\" y=\"196\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">text to speak</text><line x1=\"820\" y1=\"246\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"246\" stroke=\"#34d399\" marker-end=\"url(#flow-voice-arr)\"/><text x=\"460\" y=\"238\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">platform plays audio</text><path id=\"flow-voice-route\" d=\"M 100 78 L 280 78 L 280 120 L 460 120 L 460 162 L 640 162 L 640 204 L 820 204 L 820 246 L 100 246\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"none\"/><circle class=\"pkt\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\"><animateMotion dur=\"4.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"><mpath href=\"#flow-voice-route\"/></animateMotion></circle></svg><p>The voice platform owns signaling and media. Emergency never enters this ladder.</p><p><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-enlarge>Enlarge</button></p></article><article class=\"atlas-card\" data-atlas-diagram=\"flow-route\" data-animated=\"1\" data-kind=\"routing\"><h3><a href=\"#atlas\">Routing flow</a></h3><svg class=\"atlas-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 830 180\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Routing flow\"><rect width=\"830\" height=\"180\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#070b16\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Turn</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Router</text><rect x=\"330\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"390\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Answer</text><rect x=\"480\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"540\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Refuse</text><rect x=\"630\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"690\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Person</text><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><line x1=\"290\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><line x1=\"440\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"490\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><line x1=\"590\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"640\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><path id=\"flow-route-route\" d=\"M 140 80 L 190 80 L 290 80 L 340 80 L 440 80 L 490 80 L 590 80 L 640 80\" fill=\"none\"/><circle class=\"pkt\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\"><animateMotion dur=\"3.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"><mpath href=\"#flow-route-route\"/></animateMotion></circle></svg><p>Answer, refuse, or hand to a person. The router does not get the side-effect tool.</p><p><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-enlarge>Enlarge</button></p></article><article class=\"atlas-card\" data-atlas-diagram=\"flow-architecture\" data-animated=\"1\" data-kind=\"architecture\"><h3><a href=\"#atlas\">Architecture</a></h3><svg class=\"atlas-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 980 180\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Architecture\"><rect width=\"980\" height=\"180\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#070b16\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Input</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Policy</text><rect x=\"330\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"390\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Retrieve</text><rect x=\"480\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"540\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Model</text><rect x=\"630\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"690\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Tools</text><rect x=\"780\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"840\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Gate</text><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><line x1=\"290\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><line x1=\"440\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"490\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><line x1=\"590\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"640\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><line x1=\"740\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"790\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><path id=\"flow-architecture-route\" d=\"M 140 80 L 190 80 L 290 80 L 340 80 L 440 80 L 490 80 L 590 80 L 640 80 L 740 80 L 790 80\" fill=\"none\"/><circle class=\"pkt\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\"><animateMotion dur=\"3.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"><mpath href=\"#flow-architecture-route\"/></animateMotion></circle></svg><p>Policy, retrieval, model, tools, trace, and a gate. A person sits on side effects.</p><p><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-enlarge>Enlarge</button></p></article><article class=\"atlas-card\" data-atlas-diagram=\"flow-deploy\" data-animated=\"1\" data-kind=\"deployment\"><h3><a href=\"#atlas\">Deployment</a></h3><svg class=\"atlas-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 830 180\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Deployment\"><rect width=\"830\" height=\"180\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#070b16\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Config</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Secret</text><rect x=\"330\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"390\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Timeout</text><rect x=\"480\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"540\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Log</text><rect x=\"630\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"690\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Switch</text><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><line x1=\"290\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><line x1=\"440\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"490\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><line x1=\"590\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"640\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><path id=\"flow-deploy-route\" d=\"M 140 80 L 190 80 L 290 80 L 340 80 L 440 80 L 490 80 L 590 80 L 640 80\" fill=\"none\"/><circle class=\"pkt\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\"><animateMotion dur=\"3.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"><mpath href=\"#flow-deploy-route\"/></animateMotion></circle></svg><p>Pin the ids, keep the key out of the repo, and name the kill switch.</p><p><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-enlarge>Enlarge</button></p></article><article class=\"atlas-card\" data-atlas-diagram=\"flow-cutover\" data-animated=\"1\" data-kind=\"migration\"><h3><a href=\"#atlas\">Migration cutover</a></h3><svg class=\"atlas-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 680 180\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Migration cutover\"><rect width=\"680\" height=\"180\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#070b16\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Shadow</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Limited</text><rect x=\"330\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"390\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Wider</text><rect x=\"480\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"540\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Retire</text><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><line x1=\"290\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><line x1=\"440\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"490\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><path id=\"flow-cutover-route\" d=\"M 140 80 L 190 80 L 290 80 L 340 80 L 440 80 L 490 80\" fill=\"none\"/><circle class=\"pkt\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\"><animateMotion dur=\"3.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"><mpath href=\"#flow-cutover-route\"/></animateMotion></circle></svg><p>Users see the old path until a limited audience holds.</p><p><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-enlarge>Enlarge</button></p></article><article class=\"atlas-card\" data-atlas-diagram=\"flow-trouble\" data-animated=\"1\" data-kind=\"troubleshooting\"><h3><a href=\"#atlas\">Troubleshooting tree</a></h3><svg class=\"atlas-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 310\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Troubleshooting tree\"><rect width=\"760\" height=\"310\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#070b16\"/><rect x=\"24\" y=\"48\" width=\"250\" height=\"32\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#fbbf24\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"69\" fill=\"#fde68a\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">No trace</text><line x1=\"274\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"64\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><text x=\"352\" y=\"69\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Stop and add one</text><rect x=\"24\" y=\"96\" width=\"250\" height=\"32\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#fbbf24\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"117\" fill=\"#fde68a\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Wrong fact</text><line x1=\"274\" y1=\"112\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"112\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><text x=\"352\" y=\"117\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Was the span in the pack?</text><rect x=\"24\" y=\"144\" width=\"250\" height=\"32\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#fbbf24\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"165\" fill=\"#fde68a\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Tool error</text><line x1=\"274\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><text x=\"352\" y=\"165\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">The handler, not the tone</text><rect x=\"24\" y=\"192\" width=\"250\" height=\"32\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#fbbf24\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"213\" fill=\"#fde68a\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Should refuse</text><line x1=\"274\" y1=\"208\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"208\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><text x=\"352\" y=\"213\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">The gate failed</text><rect x=\"24\" y=\"240\" width=\"250\" height=\"32\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#fbbf24\"/><text x=\"36\" y=\"261\" fill=\"#fde68a\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Slow phone</text><line x1=\"274\" y1=\"256\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"256\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><text x=\"352\" y=\"261\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Time ASR, model, TTS</text><path id=\"flow-trouble-route\" d=\"M 274 64 L 340 64 L 274 112 L 340 112 L 274 160 L 340 160 L 274 208 L 340 208 L 274 256 L 340 256\" fill=\"none\"/><circle class=\"pkt\" r=\"5\" fill=\"#f8fafc\"><animateMotion dur=\"5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"><mpath href=\"#flow-trouble-route\"/></animateMotion></circle></svg><p>Read the trace before you edit the prompt.</p><p><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-enlarge>Enlarge</button></p></article><article class=\"atlas-card\" data-atlas-diagram=\"flow-ports\" data-animated=\"1\" data-kind=\"routing\"><h3><a href=\"#atlas\">Ports path</a></h3><svg class=\"atlas-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 880 258\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Ports path\"><rect width=\"880\" height=\"258\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#070b16\"/><defs><marker id=\"flow-ports-arr\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0 L7 3 L0 6 Z\" fill=\"#34d399\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"100\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67e8f9\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Laptop</text><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#1e3a52\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67e8f9\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">App</text><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#1e3a52\"/><text x=\"460\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67e8f9\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Model API</text><line x1=\"460\" y1=