 fill=\"#070b16\"/><rect x=\"30\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Tasks</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Run</text><rect x=\"330\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"390\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Score</text><rect x=\"480\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"540\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Compare</text><rect x=\"630\" y=\"56\" width=\"120\" height=\"48\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#10182c\" stroke=\"#22d3ee\"/><text x=\"690\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Ship</text><line x1=\"140\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><line x1=\"290\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><line x1=\"440\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"490\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><line x1=\"590\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"640\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#34d399\"/><path id=\"flow-eval-route\" d=\"M 140 80 L 190 80 L 290 80 L 340 80 L 440 80 L 490 80 L 590 80 L 640 80\" fill=\"none\"/><circle class=\"pkt\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#f8fafc\"><animateMotion dur=\"3.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"><mpath href=\"#flow-eval-route\"/></animateMotion></circle></svg><p>Same tasks. Quality, safety, latency, and cost. A person owns the gate.</p><p><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-enlarge>Enlarge</button></p></article><article class=\"atlas-card\" data-atlas-diagram=\"flow-agent\" data-animated=\"1\" data-kind=\"signal\"><