ton\" class=\"btn\" data-enlarge>Enlarge</button></p></article><article class=\"atlas-card\" data-atlas-diagram=\"flow-emergency\" data-animated=\"1\" data-kind=\"ladder\"><h3><a href=\"#atlas\">Emergency split</a></h3><svg class=\"atlas-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 700 216\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Emergency split\"><rect width=\"700\" height=\"216\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#070b16\"/><defs><marker id=\"flow-emergency-arr\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0 L7 3 L0 6 Z\" fill=\"#34d399\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"100\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67e8f9\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Caller</text><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#1e3a52\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67e8f9\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Voice platform</text><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#1e3a52\"/><text x=\"460\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#67e8f9\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">Model</text><line x1=\"460\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#1e3a52\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"78\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"78\" stroke=\"#34d399\" marker-end=\"url(#flow-emergency-arr)\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">emergency intent</text><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#34d399\" marker-end=\"url(#flow-emergency-arr)\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">platform emergency path</text><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"162\" stroke=\"#34d399\" marker-end=\"url(#flow-emergency-arr)\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#e7f6ff\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\">ordinary turn only</text><path id=\"flow-emergency-route\" d=\"M 100 78 L 280 78 L 280 120 L 280 