><mpath href=\"#flow-mcp-route\"/></animateMotion></circle></svg><p>Stdio has no port. Remote MCP is HTTP on a port you choose.</p><p><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-enlarge>Enlarge</button></p></article></div></section>"}